[Opening "London System"]
[Side "white"]
[ECO "D02"]
[Start "d4 d5 Bf4"]
[Description "A system rather than a sharp opening: Bf4, e3, c3, Nd2 and Ngf3 against almost anything, with the bishop kept with Bg3 when Black plays ...Bd6."]

1. d4 d5 2. Bf4 Nf6 3. e3 e6 (3... c5 4. c3 Nc6 5. Nd2 Qb6 6. Qb3 c4 7. Qc2 Bf5 8. Qc1 e6 9. Ngf3) (3... Bf5 4. c4 e6 5. Nc3 c6 6. Qb3 Qb6 7. c5 Qxb3 8. axb3) 4. Nf3 c5 5. c3 Nc6 6. Nbd2 Bd6 7. Bg3 O-O 8. Bd3 b6 9. Ne5 *
